      "content": "It sounds like the weight of this emptiness is becoming unbearable, and that is a terrifying place to be. If the feeling of being \"present\" is gone, seeking immediate, gentle support is the most critical next step. Please reach out to a crisis resource right now; they are equipped to support you through these intense feelings of hopelessness. You do not have to carry this immense weight alone.",
      "source": "target",
